# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DELIBERATELY TRACKED — do not add ignore rules for these
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# docs/                       the project contract, docs 01–12
# spikes/                     feasibility evidence (docs/04), never built or imported
# shared/fixtures/            canonical event fixtures shared by all three test suites
# shared/openapi/openapi.json generated but committed (FR-901/FR-902 evidence)
# deploy/docker-compose.yml   environment definition
# deploy/mosquitto/mosquitto.conf   broker config WITHOUT credentials
